+
+`tools/check-ui.sh` passed 49 application tests, Clippy with warnings denied,
+native and Wasm builds, and formatting. The app-specific contrast test covers
+secondary text at 4.5:1 (7:1 high contrast) and meaningful control edges at 3:1
+against canvas, detail, raised, hover, selection and quiet-hover surfaces in all
+three identities and all four modes. The validated theme is created at startup;
+frame rendering only resolves it.
+
+`tools/qualify-ui.sh` passed against `84af2a6a3c7a981d2b4269cc41d60decd189e771`.
+[Browser interactions](qualification/browser-interactions.json) retain ten
+journeys: physical search, the long selectable evidence tail, desktop/narrow
+navigation and Back, exact gardener confirmation, process restart/session
+invalidation, real conditional cancellation, stale confirmation conflict,
+keyboard traversal, selection/scroll across refresh, and scrolled ledger resize.
+The 5,000-obligation fixture materialised 18 rows. The warmed idle frame count
+remained stable. The browser reported WebGPU on an NVIDIA Ampere adapter.
+
+[Native interaction](qualification/native-interaction.json) retains real X11
+pointer selection, confirmation inspection and keyboard focus under Xvfb, with
+empty text and semantic audits. Its conditional durable mutation is a harness
+POST; browser qualification proves submission through the actual UI. Native
+rendering used Mesa llvmpipe. Existing screen-reader and disconnected-surface
+qualification limits remain as documented in the attention UI README.
+
+The browser harness was then extended only to retain the already-tested stale
+conflict screen, and passed again at
+`b629d4bf768768026d1d8127d98696b6dd107f3e`, with the same application code and
+Polyorama owner. [The stale confirmation rendering](qualification-stale/browser-stale-confirmation.png)
+and [its semantic observation](qualification-stale/browser-stale-confirmation.json)
+show the visible conflict reason and disabled submission; [the complete rerun](qualification-stale/browser-interactions.json)
+retains the same ten passing browser journeys. The connection has recovered by
+the screenshot while the reviewed confirmation remains stale and blocked. The
+semantic observation is taken immediately before capture. No automatic mutation
+retry occurs.
